\n\nНу что, запускаем? Пора увидеть плоды наших трудов вживую на экране! Запустить прямо сейчас?","thinking":"Yep, there are definitely ready-made presets available online! Developers often share their configurations and examples. Think of it like a shortcut – you can learn from what others have already figured out and tweak it to your needs.\n\n\nThe code creates a `ChartCanvas` object and assigns it to the `canvas` variable. Then, it sets this `canvas` as the central widget of the main window, `win`.\n\n\n"}
